  {
    id: "cpi-base-basket",
    topic: "CPI / inflation",
    prompt: "A base-year basket has 10 meals and 4 data plans. In 2024, prices are 8 and 25. In 2026, prices are 10 and 20. With 2024 as the base year, what are [[\\text{CPI}_{2026}]] and inflation from 2024 to 2026?",
